WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.385
JAMIE: I'll be watching the developer
forums on that one. The first wave

00:00:03.385 --> 00:00:06.769
JAMIE: of "it did what?" posts will be
extremely informative.

00:00:06.879 --> 00:00:10.091
RUFUS: The ECB's end-of-October deadline
is a concrete thing to watch. That's a

00:00:10.091 --> 00:00:13.303
RUFUS: two-week window. Whether those
plans are reviewed with teeth or quietly
filed

00:00:13.303 --> 00:00:16.515
RUFUS: is the question that tells you
whether AI governance in finance is

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:19.727
RUFUS: real or performative.

00:00:19.792 --> 00:00:22.224
JAMIE: Ask me again after this episode.

00:00:22.289 --> 00:00:23.971
RUFUS: I believe we've earned our exit.

00:00:24.184 --> 00:00:25.686
JAMIE: We'll be back tomorrow.

00:00:25.866 --> 00:00:27.518
ALEX: See you then.

00:00:27.608 --> 00:00:30.497
ALEX: Today’s question for you: Would
you trust an AI agent to execute

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:33.386
ALEX: multi-step tasks across your work
apps if it meant a 20% boost

00:00:33.386 --> 00:00:36.275
ALEX: in productivity?
